---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
const title = "Security Tools";
const description = "Practical security utilities for password assessment, cryptographic hashes, JWT inspection, CSP, SRI, HTTP security headers and file integrity checks.";
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
<section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="badge">Security & Hardening</span><h1>Security Tools</h1><p>Practical security utilities for password assessment, cryptographic hashes, JWT inspection, CSP, SRI, HTTP security headers and file integrity checks.</p><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>8</strong><span>Essential utilities</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Free</strong><span>Browser-based tools</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Practical</strong><span>Built for IT operations</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="label">Essential Utilities</span><h2>Choose a tool</h2><p>Focused utilities for day-to-day administration, troubleshooting and engineering work.</p></div><div class="grid"><a class="card" href="/security/password-strength-checker/"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🧪</div><span class="tag">Authentication</span><h3>Password Strength Checker</h3><p>Evaluate password length, character diversity and common weaknesses locally.</p><span class="arrow">Open tool →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/security/hash-generator/"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🔏</div><span class="tag">Integrity</span><h3>Hash Generator</h3><p>Generate SHA-256, SHA-384 and SHA-512 hashes without sending text to a server.</p><span class="arrow">Open tool →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/security/hmac-generator/"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🔐</div><span class="tag">Integrity</span><h3>HMAC Generator</h3><p>Generate HMAC signatures using SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512.</p><span class="arrow">Open tool →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/security/jwt-decoder/"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🪪</div><span class="tag">Tokens</span><h3>JWT Decoder</h3><p>Decode JWT headers and payloads locally for inspection and troubleshooting.</p><span class="arrow">Open tool →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/security/csp-generator/"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</div><span class="tag">Web Security</span><h3>CSP Generator</h3><p>Build a Content-Security-Policy header using secure, configurable directives.</p><span class="arrow">Open tool →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/security/sri-hash-generator/"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🔗</div><span class="tag">Web Security</span><h3>SRI Hash Generator</h3><p>Create Subresource Integrity hashes for script and stylesheet content.</p><span class="arrow">Open tool →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/security/security-headers-analyzer/"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📋</div><span class="tag">HTTP Security</span><h3>Security Headers Analyzer</h3><p>Paste response headers and check for important browser security controls.</p><span class="arrow">Open tool →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/security/file-checksum-generator/"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🧾</div><span class="tag">File Integrity</span><h3>File Checksum Generator</h3><p>Calculate SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 checksums for local files.</p><span class="arrow">Open tool →</span></a></div><div class="note"><strong>Privacy:</strong> Local calculations stay in your browser. Any feature that requires a remote target clearly indicates when network access is needed.</div></div></section>

<style>
  :global(*){box-sizing:border-box} :global(body){margin:0;background:#f8fafc;color:#172033;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;line-height:1.6}
  .container{width:min(calc(100% - 32px),1180px);margin:auto}.hero{padding:82px 0 66px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 12% 18%,rgba(56,189,248,.2),transparent 30%),radial-gradient(circle at 88% 20%,rgba(37,99,235,.16),transparent 32%),linear-gradient(145deg,#f8fafc,#eff6ff);text-align:center}
  .badge{display:inline-flex;padding:7px 14px;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#1d4ed8;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.hero h1{margin:18px 0 12px;color:#0f172a;font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,58px);line-height:1.08}.hero p{max-width:760px;margin:auto;color:#475569;font-size:18px}.stats{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:36px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px}.stat strong{display:block;color:#0f172a;font-size:24px}.stat span{color:#64748b;font-size:13px}
  .section{padding:72px 0}.section-head{max-width:740px;margin:0 auto 34px;text-align:center}.label{color:#2563eb;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.section-head h2{margin:9px 0;color:#0f172a;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px)}.section-head p{margin:0;color:#64748b}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.card{display:block;padding:24px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(15,23,42,.05);transition:.2s ease}.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:#93c5fd;box-shadow:0 18px 38px rgba(15,23,42,.09)}.icon{display:grid;width:48px;height:48px;place-items:center;border-radius:13px;background:#eff6ff;font-size:25px}.tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;color:#2563eb;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.card h3{margin:7px 0 8px;color:#0f172a;font-size:20px}.card p{margin:0;color:#64748b;font-size:14px}.arrow{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;color:#2563eb;font-weight:800}.note{margin-top:30px;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #dbeafe;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fbff;color:#475569}
  @media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:620px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding:60px 0 48px}}
</style>
</Layout>